; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/14e537bd48b23adb61b1b9b844bfe39c.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >难以预料的冒险，脑洞大开，幽默有梗</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >荒漠？沼泽？冰川？海滩？每次冒险都会进入随机的地图。在旅行过程中，逐渐揭示荒诞有趣的</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >动物世界！超多彩蛋目不暇接！ </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/a9b999f80bec85e2b2a9e3f3a9c8a556.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/a9b999f80bec85e2b2a9e3f3a9c8a556.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/f8d52826a0960c711499280a53e7ca8e.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/f8d52826a0960c711499280a53e7ca8e.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
