    "ja": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/25614547ea48ffe01b47cfc19685eba3.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/787fd03576cc7d97a0c3991bc0211e28.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=80 /></span>様々なスタイルのメカニマル、奇怪千万な組み合わせ数百種の防衛施設があるなんて、こんなタワーディフェンスゲームがあった？プレイヤーのメカニマル陣営によって異なる300種以上の強化。タワーも、強化も、その組み合わせによって奇妙な化学反応が起き、編成の可能性は無限大！  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/b02b66a3bd6615eccf21ff37847171c0.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=572 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/b02b66a3bd6615eccf21ff37847171c0.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/b02b66a3bd6615eccf21ff37847171c0.mp4?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/bec61ab4ada1ff335ca2051bed60462e.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=572 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/bec61ab4ada1ff335ca2051bed60462e.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/bec61ab4ada1ff335ca2051bed60462e.mp4?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/912b55e1d209a953ef48a6051fbfb0c9.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=572 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/912b55e1d209a953ef48a6051fbfb0c9.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/912b55e1d209a953ef48a6051fbfb0c9.mp4?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/440bed238639bda0394fcbf8cc585b39.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=80 /></span>プレイ方法の異なるヒーロー、豊富な操作は爽快でハマる戦闘シューティング+ローグライクは、昔ながらのタワーディフェンスとまったく異なり、テンポの早い戦闘サイクルを楽しめる。ウォースタ、メカニシカ、マウッスル、ワシュータなどの、各ヒーローは自分だけの特徴とプレイサイクルを持っている。タレットのガードを利用して陣地を建設したり、兵士をつれて出撃して敵を防いだり、一面にトラップを設置して敵をおびき出したり、ヒーローを強化してボスを一発で貫いたり、さらに多くの遊び方が待っている！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/c3e74ee5892d74f2748f765728923382.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/c3e74ee5892d74f2748f765728923382.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/51872c1e87c70c002a76275f71306608.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=80 /></span>自由に設置、巧みに計画自由度が超高い！防衛タワーは完全に自由に設置でき、防衛する基地すらも自由な位置に設置可能！自分の編成に合わせて、敵のルートを予想し、地形に応じて火力を配置しよう！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/5df8c44296acd10da8962a2ed26e093e.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/5df8c44296acd10da8962a2ed26e093e.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/57fd1dd0baea1fe63fc91e9fa34e6c59.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=80 /></span>予想できない冒険、斬新な発想に溢れ、ユーモアに溢れている砂漠？沼地？氷河？砂浜？冒険の度にランダムなマップに。旅の途中で、荒唐無稽で面白い動物の世界が明らかに！超多彩なおまけに目が釘付け！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/a9b999f80bec85e2b2a9e3f3a9c8a556.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/a9b999f80bec85e2b2a9e3f3a9c8a556.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/f8d52826a0960c711499280a53e7ca8e.poster.avif?t=1773213112\" width=600 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2453360/extras/f8d52826a0960c711499280a53e7ca8e.webm?t=1773213112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>"
